# Expansion-time error shows "in expansion of" provenance.
# The macro transformer would try to access a nonexistent argument.
# With [let ...] pattern matching, this is now an arity error at call site.
# Keep defmacro to preserve the original test intent (runtime error in transformer).
[defmacro broken [macro-args]
  [type: "var"  name: [get 5 macro-args]]
]

[broken 1]
=== error
[E001] key not found
